            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日股半日低開高收，日經平均指數以接近半日高位收市，報64,082點，倒升589點或0.93%。</p>\n</div>",
